@format 1
@id tools.install-local-flyleaf
@title Install local Flyleaf
@area Tools
@entry input
@summary Clone or update Flyleaf, patch the contrast shader, build it, and install the resulting runtime for Cadroue.
@flow TB
@related tools.discover-ffmpeg

@alias flyleaf = Cadroue.UIShell.LFlyleaf

[input] Local Flyleaf install requested <input>
- Start installation in the Cadroue Flyleaf root @ flyleaf.LFlyleafInstallStart(...)
> source

[source] Prepare source tree <external>
- Clone Flyleaf when absent, otherwise reset and fast-forward the existing checkout @ flyleaf.LFlyleafCommandRun(...)
> patch

[patch] Patch and build <external>
- Find and patch the contrast shader implementation @ flyleaf.LFlyleafShaderFind(...)
@ flyleaf.LFlyleafShaderApply(...)
- Locate and build FlyleafLib in Release configuration @ flyleaf.LFlyleafProjectFind(...)
@ flyleaf.LFlyleafCommandRun(...)
> install

[install] Install runtime <storage>
- Copy the built runtime and save its assembly and source locations @ flyleaf.LFlyleafRuntimeCreate(...)
@ flyleaf.LFlyleafInstallStart(...)
> outcome

[outcome] Evaluate installation <decision>
- Convert the completed attempt or caught exception into an installation result @ flyleaf.LFlyleafInstallStart(...)
? "Every installation step succeeds" > result
? "Any installation step throws" > failed

[result] Local Flyleaf installed <output>
= Cadroue can use the recorded local Flyleaf runtime on a subsequent load.

[failed] Installation failed <error>
- Catch, log, and return the installation failure @ flyleaf.LFlyleafInstallStart(...)
= Existing runtime state remains authoritative.

! Exceptions from source preparation, patching, building, or runtime creation are caught by the governing install method and represented by the failed outcome.
